  "details": "While managing roles and permissions within groups, I noticed that there is currently no specific permission that allows a role to only send invites.\n\nI would like to request a new, separate permission that allows group members to send invites without having the capability to remove them. This feature would be immensely helpful in allowing us to empower our members to invite new people and help our group grow, while still maintaining control over who can remove invites.",
